cabal-version:      3.0
name:               senbazuru
version:            0.1.0.0
synopsis:           Render origami crease patterns as step-by-step diagram SVGs
description:
  Senbazuru reads the FOLD file format (https://github.com/edemaine/FOLD),
  along with the .cp and .opx crease patterns the desktop editors write, and
  renders them to SVG using the line and arrow conventions of printed origami
  instruction books (the Yoshizawa-Randlett system).

homepage:           https://github.com/avalonalex/senbazuru
license:            MIT
license-file:       LICENSE
author:             Yuhan Hao
maintainer:         1143520+avalonalex@users.noreply.github.com
copyright:          (c) 2026 Yuhan Hao
category:           Graphics
build-type:         Simple
tested-with:        GHC ==9.6.7

